## Executive Summary

MedSync Core 3.0 introduces AI-powered capabilities including an intelligent assistant, automated documentation, and predictive care recommendations. This major release represents our largest investment in artificial intelligence.

---

## Problem Statement

Healthcare providers spend 40% of their time on documentation and administrative tasks. Current tools lack contextual intelligence, leading to:
- Clinician burnout
- Documentation delays
- Missed care opportunities
- Information overload

