## Feature Requirements

### F1: AI Assistant (Priority 1)

**Description**: Natural language interface for querying patient information, getting recommendations, and completing tasks.

**User Stories**:
- As a care coordinator, I want to ask questions about my patients so I can quickly get relevant information
- As a physician, I want to get AI-generated summaries so I can review patients efficiently

**Requirements**:

| ID | Requirement | Priority |
|----|-------------|----------|
| F1.1 | Natural language query interface | P1 |
| F1.2 | Patient context awareness | P1 |
| F1.3 | Care recommendation suggestions | P1 |
| F1.4 | Task creation via voice/text | P1 |
| F1.5 | Source citation for all responses | P1 |
| F1.6 | Multi-language support | P2 |
| F1.7 | Custom prompt templates | P3 |

**Acceptance Criteria**:
- [ ] Response time <3 seconds for 95% of queries
- [ ] Accuracy >90% on fact-based questions
- [ ] All recommendations cite source data
- [ ] PHI handled per security requirements

### F2: Automated Documentation (Priority 1)

**Description**: AI-generated clinical notes based on structured data and user interactions.

**Requirements**:

| ID | Requirement | Priority |
|----|-------------|----------|
| F2.1 | Auto-generate progress notes | P1 |
| F2.2 | Suggest ICD-10 codes | P1 |
| F2.3 | Template customization | P1 |
| F2.4 | Human review workflow | P1 |
| F2.5 | Version history | P2 |
| F2.6 | Specialty-specific templates | P2 |

**Acceptance Criteria**:
- [ ] Generate draft note in <10 seconds
- [ ] 70%+ of generated content accepted without edit
- [ ] Support for 15 note types at launch
- [ ] Audit trail for all AI-generated content

### F3: Care Recommendations (Priority 2)

**Description**: Proactive suggestions for care actions based on patient data, guidelines, and outcomes.

**Requirements**:

| ID | Requirement | Priority |
|----|-------------|----------|
| F3.1 | Gap-in-care alerts | P1 |
| F3.2 | Medication interaction warnings | P1 |
| F3.3 | Preventive care reminders | P2 |
| F3.4 | Social determinant prompts | P2 |
| F3.5 | Customizable rules engine | P3 |

### F4: Enhanced Patient Timeline (Priority 2)

**Description**: Visual, interactive timeline of patient health events with AI-powered insights.

**Requirements**:

| ID | Requirement | Priority |
|----|-------------|----------|
| F4.1 | Chronological event display | P1 |
| F4.2 | Event categorization | P1 |
| F4.3 | Filter and search | P1 |
| F4.4 | AI-generated event summaries | P2 |
| F4.5 | Trend visualization | P2 |

